<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Residence collections | Louayzeh Village | Pride Invests</title>
<meta name="description" content="Every apartment at Louayzeh Village: ground-floor garden apartments, first-floor simplexes, first duplexes and roof duplexes from 175 to 390 m², with sample floor plans per block group and a live apartment finder.">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/media/favicon.png">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Marcellus&family=Jost:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;1,300&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css?v={{ build.time }}">
</head>
<body class="has-action-bar">

{% set nav_solid = true %}{% include "nav.njk" %}

<main class="page plans-page">
  <div class="page-head">
    <a class="fp-back" href="/projects/louayzeh-village/"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5M11 18l-6-6 6-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span>Back to Louayzeh Village</span></a>
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/projects/">Projects</a> / <a href="/projects/louayzeh-village/">Louayzeh Village</a> / Residences</nav>
    <h1 class="page-title">Residence collections</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">Four residence collections span the village, each with its own set of apartments and floor plans.<br>Spot your block on the plan below, then open its collection to see the floor plans.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="with-rail">
    <div>
      <section class="detail-section" id="blocks" style="margin-top:0">
        <div class="slider reveal" id="gallerySlider" style="margin-bottom:36px">
          <div class="sl-item on" data-cap="The village from the front · blocks A – R" data-full="/media/projects/louayzeh/blocks-labeled.jpg"><img src="/media/projects/louayzeh/blocks-labeled.jpg" alt="Aerial render of Louayzeh Village with every block labeled from A to R"></div>
          <div class="sl-item" data-cap="Master plan · locate your block" data-full="/media/projects/louayzeh/master-plan-labeled.jpg"><img src="/media/projects/louayzeh/master-plan-labeled.jpg" alt="Labeled master plan of Louayzeh Village showing the position of every block from A to R" loading="lazy"></div>
          <button class="sl-arrow sl-prev" aria-label="Previous image">‹</button>
          <button class="sl-arrow sl-next" aria-label="Next image">›</button>
          <span class="sl-caption"></span>
          <div class="sl-dots" role="tablist"></div>
        </div>

        <article class="res-card reveal" id="blocks-cdopq">
          <a class="res-cover" href="/projects/louayzeh-village/floor-plans/classic-residences/" aria-label="Open The Classic Residences floor plans"></a>
          <div class="res-head">
            <div><p class="res-kicker">Blocks C · D · O · P · Q</p><h3>The Classic Residences</h3></div>
            <span class="res-price">175 – 299 m²</span>
          </div>
          <p class="res-sub">Five blocks, one shared set of apartments and floor plans · 2 apartments per floor</p>
          <div class="res-units">
            <div class="ru"><span>Ground floor apartment</span><b>175 m² + 75 m² garden</b></div>
            <div class="ru"><span>First floor apartment</span><b>175 m²</b></div>
            <div class="ru"><span>First duplex · two levels</span><b>299 m² + 57 m² garden</b></div>
            <div class="ru"><span>Roof duplex · two levels</span><b>270 m²</b></div>
          </div>
        
          <span class="res-link">View floor plans</span>
        </article>

        <article class="res-card reveal" id="blocks-mn">
          <a class="res-cover" href="/projects/louayzeh-village/floor-plans/select-residences/" aria-label="Open The Select Residences floor plans"></a>
          <div class="res-head">
            <div><p class="res-kicker">Blocks M · N</p><h3>The Select Residences</h3></div>
            <span class="res-price">180 – 309 m²</span>
          </div>
          <p class="res-sub">Two blocks, one shared set of apartments and floor plans · 2 apartments per floor</p>
          <div class="res-units">
            <div class="ru"><span>Ground floor apartment</span><b>180 m² + 87 m² garden</b></div>
            <div class="ru"><span>First floor apartment</span><b>180 m²</b></div>
            <div class="ru"><span>First duplex · two levels</span><b>309 m² + 54 m² garden</b></div>
            <div class="ru"><span>Roof duplex · two levels</span><b>277 m²</b></div>
          </div>
        
          <span class="res-link">View floor plans</span>
        </article>

        <article class="res-card reveal" id="blocks-abfghijk">
          <a class="res-cover" href="/projects/louayzeh-village/floor-plans/grand-residences/" aria-label="Open The Grand Residences floor plans"></a>
          <div class="res-head">
            <div><p class="res-kicker">Blocks A · B · F · G · H · I · J · K</p><h3>The Grand Residences</h3></div>
            <span class="res-price">190 – 327 m²</span>
          </div>
          <p class="res-sub">Eight blocks, one shared set of apartments and floor plans · 2 apartments per floor</p>
          <div class="res-units">
            <div class="ru"><span>Ground floor apartment</span><b>190 m² + 81 m² garden</b></div>
            <div class="ru"><span>First floor apartment</span><b>190 m²</b></div>
            <div class="ru"><span>First duplex · two levels</span><b>327 m² + 96 m² garden</b></div>
            <div class="ru"><span>Roof duplex · two levels</span><b>289 m²</b></div>
          </div>
        
          <span class="res-link">View floor plans</span>
        </article>

        <article class="res-card reveal" id="blocks-elr">
          <a class="res-cover" href="/projects/louayzeh-village/floor-plans/full-floor-residences/" aria-label="Open The Full-Floor Residences floor plans"></a>
          <div class="res-head">
            <div><p class="res-kicker">Blocks E · L · R</p><h3>The Full-Floor Residences</h3></div>
            <span class="res-price">227 – 390 m²</span>
          </div>
          <p class="res-sub">Three blocks, one shared set of apartments and floor plans · one full-floor apartment per level</p>
          <div class="res-units">
            <div class="ru"><span>Ground floor apartment</span><b>227 m² + 159 m² garden</b></div>
            <div class="ru"><span>Second floor apartment</span><b>227 m²</b></div>
            <div class="ru"><span>First duplex · two levels</span><b>390 m² + 96 m² garden</b></div>
            <div class="ru"><span>Roof duplex · two levels</span><b>322 m²</b></div>
          </div>
        
          <span class="res-link">View floor plans</span>
        </article>
      </section>

      <!-- ══ louayzeh-only apartment finder ══ -->
      <section class="finder" id="finder" style="margin-top:64px">
        <h2 class="section-title reveal" style="margin-bottom:10px">Find your apartment</h2>
        <p class="finder-sub reveal">Select your preferences and the matching apartments appear below.</p>
        <div class="finder-bar reveal">
          <div class="fld">
            <label class="sr-only" for="fType">Apartment type</label>
            <select id="fType">
              <option value="all">All types</option>
              <option value="Apartment">One-floor apartment</option>
              <option value="Duplex">Duplex · two levels</option>
              <option value="Roof duplex">Roof duplex · two levels</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="fld">
            <label class="sr-only" for="fBeds">Bedrooms</label>
            <select id="fBeds">
              <option value="all">Bedrooms · any</option>
              <option value="3">3 bedrooms</option>
              <option value="4">4 bedrooms</option>
              <option value="5">5 bedrooms</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="fld">
            <label class="sr-only" for="fSize">Interior size</label>
            <select id="fSize">
              <option value="all">Size · any</option>
              <option value="s1">Under 200 m²</option>
              <option value="s2">200 to 300 m²</option>
              <option value="s3">300 to 400 m²</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="fld">
            <label class="sr-only" for="fFloor">Floor</label>
            <select id="fFloor">
              <option value="all">Floor · any</option>
              <option value="Ground">Ground floor</option>
              <option value="First">First floor</option>
              <option value="Second">Second floor</option>
              <option value="Third">Third floor</option>
              <option value="multi">Duplex · multi-level</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="fld">
            <label class="sr-only" for="fGarden">Garden</label>
            <select id="fGarden">
              <option value="all">Garden · any</option>
              <option value="yes">With garden</option>
              <option value="no">Without garden</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="fld">
            <label class="sr-only" for="fTerr">Terrace</label>
            <select id="fTerr">
              <option value="all">Terrace · any</option>
              <option value="yes">With terrace</option>
              <option value="no">Without terrace</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="fld">
            <label class="sr-only" for="fSort">Sort by</label>
            <select id="fSort">
              <option value="size-asc">Sort · small to large</option>
              <option value="size-desc">Sort · large to small</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="finder-reset" id="fReset">Reset filters</button>
        </div>
        <p class="finder-count" id="finderCount" style="display:none"></p>
        <div class="unit-grid" id="unitGrid" data-location="Louayzeh" data-wait-for-filter></div>
        <p class="finder-empty" id="finderEmpty" style="display:none">No apartments match these filters yet. Try widening your search, or ask our team what is coming next.</p>
      </section>
    </div>

    {% include "rail.njk" %}
  </div>
</main>

